# Per-run evidence (regenerated by every mode; the sheet names the paths).
evidence/
# The kovee-side driver's own build products: it is its own workspace, and
# nothing in byom's lockfile may depend on it.
#
# Its `Cargo.lock` used to be ignored here too, on the reasoning that the
# workspace is not byom's. But the gate COMPILES that workspace, so the
# lockfile decides which bytes the driver links — and an ignored lockfile is
# an unpinned compiled input, which the R3 confirmation found (finding 2). It
# is committed, and `source_pin` checks it against byom's HEAD like every
# other input.
kovee-driver/target/
__pycache__/
